  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.1.0-rc-1\n- Breaking: endpoint attribute types are now sealed\n- Excluded route keys from JSON request serialization\n- Added support for reading non-seekable file and response streams\n- Added string route key encoding and decoding\n- Fixed parent route key handling in Location for multipart POST-create requests\n- Improved request metadata and route property lookup performance\n- Fixed 201 Created Location paths to honor PathBase and omit the header when the resource key is unavailable\n- Fixed query binding for decimal values and case-insensitive nested parameters\n- Preserved explicitly supplied nullable defaults and regular Key properties in query strings\n- Included request fields alongside the file in multipart uploads\n- Preserved quotes and whitespace in plain-text responses\n- Removed route keys from OpenAPI JSON request schemas while preserving response schemas",
